why Experience at 50, ending in the Sunken Temple; Forever removed the Classic item choice.

# The level 50-52 Warrior quests: A Troubled Spirit (8417) from any warrior
# trainer of the capitals, then Warrior Kinship, War on the Shadowsworn and
# Voodoo Feathers (8423, 8424, 8425) for the Fallen Hero of the Horde at the
# entrance to the Blasted Lands.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json for the chain, objectives,
# drops and places; Forever's Warrior class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): Voodoo Feathers no longer
# offers its Classic choice of Diamond Flask, Fury Visor or Razorsteel
# Shoulders, and the list does not say what replaces it. The voodoo feathers
# drop from the Atal'ai minibosses on the Sunken Temple's balcony, which have
# no spawns in the data (Forever's dungeon data,
# "Balcony Minibosses"); the temple entrance, Swamp of Sorrows 69.9,53.6, is
# the one guides/forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater.guide uses.
# No leveling guide takes the chain: Voodoo Feathers needs the Sunken Temple.
# Level 50 and up is above the beta's level cap: this guide is written from
# the data, not from play.

step A Troubled Spirit (Stormwind)
  only Human,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 50, Wu Shen in Old Town, beside the Pig and Whistle, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows.
  level 50
  accept 8417 npc 5479                        -- Wu Shen

step A Troubled Spirit (Ironforge)
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 50, Kelv Sternhammer, the warrior trainer of Ironforge, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows.
  level 50
  accept 8417 npc 5113                        -- Kelv Sternhammer

step A Troubled Spirit (Darnassus)
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip At 50, Darnath Bladesinger, the warrior trainer of Darnassus, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows.
  level 50
  accept 8417 npc 7315                        -- Darnath Bladesinger

step A Troubled Spirit (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 50, Sorek in the Valley of Honor sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows.
  level 50
  accept 8417 npc 3354                        -- Sorek

step A Troubled Spirit (Thunder Bluff)
  only Tauren
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 50, Torm Ragetotem, the warrior trainer of Thunder Bluff, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows.
  level 50
  accept 8417 npc 3041                        -- Torm Ragetotem

step A Troubled Spirit (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 50, Christoph Walker, a warrior trainer of the Undercity, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows.
  level 50
  accept 8417 npc 4593                        -- Christoph Walker

step The Fallen Hero of the Horde
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip The Fallen Hero of the Horde stands in the south-west of the Swamp of Sorrows, at the entrance to the Blasted Lands.
  turnin 8417                                 -- Fallen Hero of the Horde
  accept 8423

step Helboars
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip The Helboars roam the north of the Blasted Lands, south of the Fallen Hero.
  kill 5993 quest 8423.1                      -- Helboar

step War on the Shadowsworn
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  turnin 8423                                 -- Fallen Hero of the Horde
  accept 8424

step Shadowsworn camps
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip The Shadowsworn cultists hold the east of the Blasted Lands.
  kill 6006 quest 8424.1                      -- Shadowsworn Adept
  kill 6004 quest 8424.2                      -- Shadowsworn Cultist
  kill 6005 quest 8424.3                      -- Shadowsworn Thug

step Voodoo Feathers
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  turnin 8424                                 -- Fallen Hero of the Horde
  accept 8425

step The Sunken Temple
  tip The Sunken Temple lies under the Pool of Tears in the east of the Swamp of Sorrows. Each of the six Atal'ai trolls on the balcony drops a voodoo feather: Gasher or Zul'Lor the amber, Hukku or Mijan the blue, Zolo or Loro the green. The Sunken Temple is a dungeon and the trolls are elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 20606 quest 8425.1 @69.9,53.6       -- Amber Voodoo Feather
  collect 20607 quest 8425.2 @69.9,53.6       -- Blue Voodoo Feather
  collect 20608 quest 8425.3 @69.9,53.6       -- Green Voodoo Feather

step Back to the Fallen Hero
  turnin 8425                                 -- Fallen Hero of the Horde
